en's standing rule: don't overpromise to Galwick Analytics; last time we slipped we lost a month."], "5": ["Sararidrin is cytotoxic in line TB-48; this is confirmed. Our own cytotoxicity panel is scheduled for Friday: Sararidrin at eight concentrations in TB-48 and two other lines, 48h exposure, viability readout, triplicate wells. Sararidrin inventory is 91 mg across 3 vials with a 6-week synthesis lead time for more. Aaliyah (biosafety) said normal handling precautions are fine for now but the risk assessment will be revisited if our panel shows anything.", "Sararidrin is cytotoxic in line TB-48; this is confirmed. Our own cytotoxicity panel is scheduled for Friday: Sararidrin at eight concentrations in TB-48 and two other lines, 48h exposure, viability readout, triplicate wells. Sararidrin inventory is 91 mg across 3 vials with a 6-week synthesis lead time for more. Aaliyah (biosafety) said normal handling precautions are fine for now but the risk assessment will be revisited if our panel shows anything."]}}
